{"type":"text","timestamp":1794529934724,"sessionID":"ses_e2dafa54cffey3bTkG8tAApBE7","part":{"id":"prt_1d251b030002dY1t1o4KZVKYaE","sessionID":"ses_e2dafa54cffey3bTkG8tAApBE7","messageID":"msg_1d251a4ab001DgzYl1UyC1KXjt","type":"text","text":"T041 is complete, and the probe confirms the cause T044 targets: the top row is `create:agent`, its confidence is floored, and it is clustered with other floored rows. T044 does not need `[B]`.\n\nFiles written (both under the phase `scratch/` folder):\n- `agent-ambiguity.mjs` sets `VITEST`, imports `scoreAdvisorPrompt` from the built scorer in `dist/runtime`, and prints the ambiguity verdict plus the top four rows with skill, confidence, score, `confidenceFloored` and the `ambiguousWith` length.\n- `agent-ambiguity.txt` holds the probe output.\n\nVerify output, from `node specs/.../scratch/agent-ambiguity.mjs` with exit 0, saved to `agent-ambiguity.txt`:\n\n```\nprompt /create:agent dependency-auditor for release checks\nambiguous true\n1. create:agent confidence=0.82 score=0.4840 confidenceFloored=true ambiguousWith=8\n2. sk-doc confidence=0.82 score=0.4317 confidenceFloored=true ambiguousWith=0\n3. system-spec-kit confidence=0.82 score=0.1997 confidenceFloored=true ambiguousWith=8\n4. sk-code confidence=0.82 score=0.1639 confidenceFloored=true ambiguousWith=8\ncluster size=8 flooredMembers=6\n```\n\nThe top row carries `confidenceFloored=true` with a cluster of 8, of which 6 carry the floor. Rows 3 and 4 sit far below the top on score yet still cluster, because every floored row is pinned to the same 0.82 confidence, which is exactly the `clustersWithTop` behavior T044 changes. Row 2 shares the floor but is excluded as the command owner's same route, so it reports a zero cluster length.\n\nNothing was blocked and `tasks.md` was not edited. Nothing is waiting on you, and the next task in this carry group is T044.","time":{"start":1794529931312,"end":1794529934724}}}
